[en.DECISION_C01_EMPRESS_TOUR]
Empress Inspection Tour: §Y[FROM.GetName]§!

[en.DECISION_C01_EMPRESS_TOUR_desc]
Cozy Glow takes on an inspection tour in §Y[FROM.GetName]§!, giving a public speech in an attempt to suppress the local independence movement.

[en.DECISION_C01_EMPRESS_TOUR_TOOLTIP]
§Y[FROM.GetName]§! will not be able to proceed national focuses and certain decisions about independence until the end of the inspection tour.

[en.DECISION_C01_EMPRESS_TOUR_SUPPRESSING_TOOLTIP]
Cozy Glow is currently inspecting another territory.

[zh.DECISION_C01_EMPRESS_TOUR]
女皇巡察：§Y[FROM.GetName]§!

[zh.DECISION_C01_EMPRESS_TOUR_desc]
和煦光流到§Y[FROM.GetName]§!进行巡察，发表公开演说，意图压制当地的独立运动。

[zh.DECISION_C01_EMPRESS_TOUR_TOOLTIP]
§Y[FROM.GetName]§!在巡察结束前将无法推进关于独立的国策和部分决议。

[zh.DECISION_C01_EMPRESS_TOUR_SUPPRESSING_TOOLTIP]
和煦光流正在巡察另一片领土。
